    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.poster.avif?t=1746758738\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.webm?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.mp4?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've taken a temporary job as a forest ranger, deep in the remote mountains. Your tasks are simple: clean the cabin, maintain equipment, sort trash, and monitor the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something feels off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.poster.avif?t=1746758738\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.webm?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.mp4?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix broken machines, manage power systems, put out campfires, and inspect storm damage\u2014while strange noises and unexplained events slowly creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in the forest wants to be found</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tasks across different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.poster.avif?t=1746758738\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.webm?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/a971ba328c78e8575a5d5f83ba43ee22.mp4?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've taken a temporary job as a forest ranger, deep in the remote mountains. Your tasks are simple: clean the cabin, maintain equipment, sort trash, and monitor the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something feels off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.poster.avif?t=1746758738\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.webm?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727650/extras/65eef91829d9ebe74d4a6997ea10bdaf.mp4?t=1746758738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix broken machines, manage power systems, put out campfires, and inspect storm damage\u2014while strange noises and unexplained events slowly creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in the forest wants to be found</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tasks across different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
